				"name": "mapColumns.count",
				"type": "number",
				"required": true,
				"description": "The number of units in the map: mapColumns takes the ceiling of the square root of count times 0.75 as the row width, and harnessLayout passes the length of its units array here when perRow is omitted. The result is clamped to between 6 and 24, so every count from 0 to 48 gives 6 and a negative count gives NaN.",
