				"name": "harnessLayout.units",
				"type": "HarnessUnit[]",
				"required": true,
				"description": "The units to place, each with an id and a dependencies list of { unit, via } entries that name other units by id; an entry naming a unit missing from the array is ignored. Nothing validates the array, so a unit with no dependencies array fails at runtime, and in a dependency cycle the layers depend on the order of the units.",
